# API client certificate CN
user api-service
topic readwrite sites/#

# Gateway client certificate CN must equal Gateway.id.
pattern read sites/+/gateways/%u/commands/#
pattern read sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/state-ingested
pattern read sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/provisioning/scan-terminal-ingested
pattern read sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/automation/execution-ingested
pattern read sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/automation/vehicle-sensor-capability-ingested
pattern write sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/acceptance
pattern write sites/+/gateways/%u/acks/device-status
pattern write sites/+/gateways/%u/state/#
pattern write sites/+/gateways/%u/events/#
